        "type": "text",
        "label": "Photography & art direction",
        "body": "Product: sheets, pillows, fibres, details and textures. Interior: rooms, architecture, light and stillness. Lifestyle: rituals, people and everyday comfort. Editorial: atmosphere, material and quiet luxury. Campaign: big ideas, memory, story and film."
